user_prompt_template:
Analyze the following startup idea:
Project Title: {project_title}
Startup Idea: {idea_title}
Problem Statement: {problem_statement}
Solution Description: {solution_description}
Target Users: {target_users}
Industry: {industry}
Business Model: {business_model}
Stage: {stage}

Provide the response strictly as a JSON object with keys: 'summary' (concise paragraph), 'score' (integer 0-100), 'strengths' (list of 4-6 strings), 'weaknesses' (list of 4-6 strings), 'recommendations' (list of 3-5 strings), 'confidence' (float between 0.0 and 1.0, e.g. 0.85), 'dimensions' (object with integer 0-100 scores for 'innovation', 'market_potential', 'technical_feasibility', 'business_viability', 'scalability', 'execution_complexity', 'competitive_differentiation'), and 'architecture_breakdown' (mermaid diagram markdown).
